{"message":"Great! Now please enable the storage permission for the Messaging app. On your device, run:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="storage")

Once you’ve done that, let me know and we’ll proceed to the next step."}

{"message":"Next, please grant your messaging app permission to send SMS. On your phone, run:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="sms")

Let me know once you’ve done that."}

{"message":"Next, please grant your messaging app permission to access storage. On your phone, run:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="storage")

Let me know once you’ve done that."}

{"message":"Let’s verify your APN settings to ensure the MMSC URL is correct. Please run:

check_apn_settings()

and share what it returns."}

{"message":"Yes, please go ahead and reboot your phone now by running:

reboot_device()

Once it restarts, try sending an MMS again and let me know whether it goes through."}
